# README screenshots: not a test (tests/run_tests.sh doesn't touch this file). A normal boot, a
# real demo pattern programmed through the panel like showcase.x0x does, screenshotted for docs.
# The boot splash holds real drawing for 3600 ms (host/web half-speed hold - dwnlo_splash.c /
# ui_frame's "holding" curtain): input still works underneath, so the pattern gets programmed
# right away, but no shot can show anything until well past that.
#
# "### BURST name N" is not a real host command: tools/gen_readme_screens.sh expands each one into
# N "wait 120 / shot name_NN.png" pairs (120 ms = one 16th note at 125 BPM, so N=16 is one exact
# bar, looping seamlessly) before running this through the simulator.
#   tools/gen_readme_screens.sh
wait 300
tap PLAY

# ---- 909 (part 0): 4/4 - downbeat kick, clap on 2 and 4, upbeat closed hats
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
tapkey b6
tapkey w4
tapkey w12
tapkey b7
tapkey w2
tapkey w6
tapkey w10
tapkey w14
wait 3800
### BURST sequencer 16

# ---- 808 (part 1): cowbell, rim
turn ALGO 1
expect part 1
tapkey b7
tapkey w3
tapkey w10
tapkey b5
tapkey w6
tapkey w13
tap EDIT
### BURST part_808 16
tap EDIT

# ---- 303 (part 2): a TB-3PO generated acid line
turn ALGO 1
expect part 2
tap ARP
tap OCT+
tap SEQ
### BURST part_303 16

# ---- 808 Bassline (part 3): an actual bassline - 8th notes walking up to the octave and back
# down past the root (KNOB 1 on a held step moves its note by semitones; empty steps default
# to the root, so a 0-semitone step is just tapped)
turn ALGO 1
expect part 3
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
key w2 down
turn K1 3
key w2 up
key w4 down
turn K1 7
key w4 up
key w6 down
turn K1 12
key w6 up
key w8 down
turn K1 7
key w8 up
key w10 down
turn K1 3
key w10 up
tapkey w12
key w14 down
turn K1 -5
key w14 up
tap EDIT
### BURST part_bassline 16

# ---- BLIP (part 4): a quick run, SOUND page (Tune, Decay, Bright, Glide)
turn ALGO 1
expect part 4
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
tapkey w2
tapkey w4
tapkey w6
tap EDIT
### BURST part_blip 16
tap EDIT

# ---- mixer (LFO button)
tap LFO
### BURST mixer 16

tap PLAY
